# install.sh's INSTALL_DIR and MOE_DATA_ROOT default to the same path
# (/opt/moe-sovereign), so on an unmodified install these bind-mount data
# directories (see install.sh's `mkdir -p .../<name>` list and the
# `_upd_chown` calls in its update path) live inside this build context.
# Several are chowned to a restrictive non-root uid (e.g. langgraph-
# checkpoints -> 70:70, mode 0700 for Postgres); buildx's context sender
# then fails with "permission denied" for whichever user invoked the
# build, aborting the update entirely. Keep this list in sync with
# install.sh's directory list.
